    "asOf": "2026-10-14",
    "items": [
      {
        "text": "John M. Erickson is a West Hollywood City Councilmember, elected in 2020. He works as Chief of Staff for the Alliance for a Better Community and is a former vice president of Planned Parenthood Los Angeles. He previously served as a council deputy, a legislative representative at LAX, and president of the ACLU of Southern California. His campaign priorities include faster permitting, renters’ rights, homelessness programs, and insurance affordability for areas rebuilding from fire. He says he was part of the 2016 campaign that overturned California’s statute of limitations on rape.",
